WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.131 --> 00:00:11.501
&gt;&gt; WELCOME BACK TO THE INGRAM

00:00:11.502 --> 00:00:11.802
ANGLE.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:14.371
TODAY WE VISIT IN A LOCAL PUB

00:00:14.372 --> 00:00:16.039
WITH NIGEL.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.141
&gt;&gt; I JUST WALKED INTO A PUB.

00:00:18.142 --> 00:00:19.810
LOOK I WALK IN A PUB AND LOOK

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:20.811
WHAT YOU RUN INTO.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:22.379
&gt;&gt; THE REPUTATION IS TRUE.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.079
&gt;&gt; EXACTLY.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.414
&gt;&gt; TODAY WE WERE AMONG SOME OF

00:00:24.415 --> 00:00:26.750
THE PROTESTERS, SEVERAL THOUSAND

00:00:26.751 --> 00:00:28.852
PEOPLE, MAYBE 10,000 PEOPLE IN

00:00:28.853 --> 00:00:29.619
TRAFALGAR SQUARE.

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.388
THERE WERE COMMUNIST,

00:00:31.389 --> 00:00:32.589
SOCIALISTS, AND PEOPLE WHO ARE

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:33.990
JUST ANTI-TRUMP IN THE MOST

00:00:33.991 --> 00:00:35.225
VEHEMENT WAY.

00:00:35.226 --> 00:00:39.963
THEY WERE ANTI-TRUMP,

00:00:39.964 --> 00:00:40.997
ANTI-BREXIT, ANTI-NIGEL.

00:00:40.998 --> 00:00:42.365
&gt;&gt; PLEASED TO BE IN THAT.

00:00:42.366 --> 00:00:43.800
IF MY NAME WASN'T THERE, I WOULD

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:44.768
BE SO UPSET.

00:00:44.769 --> 00:00:46.403
YOU TALK ABOUT PROTESTERS.

00:00:46.404 --> 00:00:48.738
THEY'RE WHO I CALL THE USUAL

00:00:48.739 --> 00:00:49.105
SUSPECTS.

00:00:49.106 --> 00:00:50.707
THEY ARE THE PEOPLE -- ARE THEY

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:51.942
INCLUDING MY MEETINGS, OF

00:00:51.943 --> 00:00:54.211
COURSE, BUT AMONG THEM, MORE

00:00:54.212 --> 00:00:55.345
SIGNIFICANTLY WAS ONE JEREMY

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:55.679
CORBIN.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.314
SO HERE'S THE GUY WHO COULD BE

00:00:57.315 --> 00:00:59.015
THE NEXT BRITISH PRIME MINISTER

00:00:59.016 --> 00:01:00.150
AFTER THE NEXT ELECTION.

00:01:00.151 --> 00:01:02.752
AFTER ATTENDING A STATE BANQUET

00:01:02.753 --> 00:01:05.789
AT BUCKINGHAM PALACE, HE'S AT

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.824
TRAFALGAR SQUARE, 70 YEARS OLD,

00:01:07.825 --> 00:01:09.960
ALMOST LIKE A LEFT WING STUDENT

00:01:09.961 --> 00:01:10.360
POLITICIAN.

00:01:10.361 --> 00:01:11.595
HE JUST DOES NOT LOOK LIKE A

00:01:11.596 --> 00:01:13.129
PRIME MINISTER IN THE EYES OF

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:13.530
PEOPLE.

00:01:13.531 --> 00:01:17.934
SO I WELCOME THEY'LL LOSE IN A

00:01:17.935 --> 00:01:18.935
BIG WAY.

00:01:18.936 --> 00:01:20.270
&gt;&gt; Laura: YOU SEE THE PRESIDENT

00:01:20.271 --> 00:01:22.506
WITH THERESA MAY TODAY, OUTGOING

00:01:22.507 --> 00:01:29.179
PRIME MINISTER.

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:31.114
IS THAT REALISTIC GIVEN THE FLUX

00:01:31.115 --> 00:01:32.315
THAT WE'RE IN.

00:01:32.316 --> 00:01:33.783
&gt;&gt; COMPLETELY REALIST INGE.

00:01:33.784 --> 00:01:36.186
I HAVE TO SAY I'M TIRED OF

00:01:36.187 --> 00:01:37.687
CONVERSATION.

00:01:37.688 --> 00:01:39.489
SHOULD WE TALK ABOUT A TRADE

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.024
DEAL, I THINK IT'S TIME TO ACT.

00:01:41.025 --> 00:01:43.393
I THINK IT'S TIME WE FORM A

00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:44.694
COMMITTEE OF INDUSTRIALIST MEN

00:01:44.695 --> 00:01:45.128
AND WOMEN.

00:01:45.129 --> 00:01:46.429
AMERICANS DO THE SAME.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:47.664
WHY DON'T WE WORK ON THIS.

00:01:47.665 --> 00:01:49.666
&gt;&gt; FOR PEOPLE IN THE UNITED

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:50.433
STATES WHO DON'T QUITE

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:51.935
UNDERSTAND IT, IT'S VERY

00:01:51.936 --> 00:01:53.203
DIFFERENT FROM OUR OWN.

00:01:53.204 --> 00:01:56.373
COULD YOU FORM A COALITION, A

00:01:56.374 --> 00:01:57.974
BREXIT PARTY, ONLY STARTED TWO

00:01:57.975 --> 00:01:59.910
MONTHS AGO WITH THE CONSERVATIVE

00:01:59.911 --> 00:02:00.210
PARTY.

00:02:00.211 --> 00:02:02.112
IT HAD A TERRIBLE SHOWING IN THE

00:02:02.113 --> 00:02:03.914
EU NATIONAL ELECTIONS NEXT WEEK.

00:02:03.915 --> 00:02:06.583
&gt;&gt; A LOT OF PERMATIONS THERE.

00:02:06.584 --> 00:02:08.118
ONE IS THAT THE CONSERVATIVE

00:02:08.119 --> 00:02:11.821
PARTY CONTINUES TO FAIL ON

00:02:11.822 --> 00:02:12.956
BREXIT AND YOU CAN SEE THE DEATH

00:02:12.957 --> 00:02:13.823
OF A PARTY.

00:02:13.824 --> 00:02:14.758
THESE THINGS HAPPEN.

00:02:14.759 --> 00:02:17.527
MORE REALISTICALLY, THEY'LL GET

00:02:17.528 --> 00:02:20.096
A LEADER WITH A LITTLE BIT MORE

00:02:20.097 --> 00:02:20.430
COURAGE.

00:02:20.431 --> 00:02:21.698
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHO IS IT?

00:02:21.699 --> 00:02:24.034
&gt;&gt; IT COULD BE -- BORIS TALKS A

00:02:24.035 --> 00:02:25.135
BIG GAME.

00:02:25.136 --> 00:02:26.636
BUT OFTEN DOESN'T DELIVER.

00:02:26.637 --> 00:02:27.604
&gt;&gt; Laura: BORIS JOHNSON?

00:02:27.605 --> 00:02:29.439
&gt;&gt; HE'S A GREAT PERSONALITY.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.240
PEOPLE KNOW HIM.

00:02:30.241 --> 00:02:32.075
WE HAVE TO SEE WHO EMERGES OUT

00:02:32.076 --> 00:02:32.776
OF THIS.

00:02:32.777 --> 00:02:35.245
THE GREAT BATTLE OF THE WEST.

00:02:35.246 --> 00:02:36.513
GLOBALISM VERSUS NATIONALISM.

00:02:36.514 --> 00:02:37.747
THAT'S THE DEBATE GOING ON.

00:02:37.748 --> 00:02:40.317
THE ISSUE OF OUR TIMES AND THE

00:02:40.318 --> 00:02:41.618
EPICENTER IS HERE IN LONDON

00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:42.118
RIGHT NOW.

00:02:42.119 --> 00:02:43.987
I CAN TELL YOU, HAVING BEEN

00:02:43.988 --> 00:02:45.855
25 -- YOU KNOW THIS, I SPENT 25

00:02:45.856 --> 00:02:47.991
YEARS FIGHTING FOR THIS.

00:02:47.992 --> 00:02:50.193
I AM ABSOLUTELY CERTAIN THAT

00:02:50.194 --> 00:02:51.761
BRITISH PUBLIC OPINION IS WITH

00:02:51.762 --> 00:02:52.028
US.

00:02:52.029 --> 00:02:53.897
THE BRITISH MIDDLE CLASS HAVEN'T

00:02:53.898 --> 00:02:55.532
QUITE WOKEN UP TO IT.

00:02:55.533 --> 00:02:58.301
BUT I'M GOING MAKE SURE THEY DO.

00:02:58.302 --> 00:02:59.970
&gt;&gt; Laura: FLASH FORWARD -- JOE

00:02:59.971 --> 00:03:01.371
BIDEN SOMEHOW WINS THE

00:03:01.372 --> 00:03:03.273
NOMINATION, HE WINS THE

00:03:03.274 --> 00:03:04.274
NOMINATION BUT HE ENDS UP

00:03:04.275 --> 00:03:05.241
WINNING THE PRESIDENCY.

00:03:05.242 --> 00:03:08.812
WHAT WOULD THAT MEAN TO THE

00:03:08.813 --> 00:03:09.779
GLOBALIST INFLUENCE IN EUROPE.

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:10.914
THEY'D BE THRILLED, WOULD THEY

00:03:10.915 --> 00:03:12.515
NOT BE, TO GO BACK TO BUSINESS

00:03:12.516 --> 00:03:13.483
AS USUAL.

00:03:13.484 --> 00:03:15.318
&gt;&gt; WE'RE ON THE RIGHT TRACK.

00:03:15.319 --> 00:03:17.754
BUT, I FEEL THAT IF BREXIT WAS

00:03:17.755 --> 00:03:20.256
TO FAIL, THAT WOULD BE THE

00:03:20.257 --> 00:03:22.293
